  "description": "Backoffice GUI for Umbraco 18's scheduled background jobs. A Settings-section dashboard lists every recurring (IRecurringBackgroundJob) and distributed (IDistributedBackgroundJob) task — Umbraco's own and yours — with its schedule, status, last and next run. Editors can run a task now, pause and resume it, change its schedule (an interval, or calendar times such as every Monday at 07:00, the 1st of every month, a date every year, or cron, in their time zone), set the task's own properties with Umbraco's property editors (e.g. a content-tree picker for the page a clean-up job works below), stop a running task, set retries and a time limit, and inspect every server's runs (saved in the database) with error details and the log lines each run wrote. A change log records who changed what, settings move between environments with export/import, and the UI is in English and Swedish. Works with existing jobs unchanged.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
